[
  {
    "content_id": "10025001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;從前人煙稠密的城， 現在何其荒涼！ 從前揚威列邦的強國， 現在竟像寡婦！ 從前在諸省貴為公主， 現在卻淪為奴婢！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;她在夜間痛哭，淚流滿面。 情人中沒有一個前來安慰。 朋友都出賣她，與她為敵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;猶大飽受苦難和奴役， 被擄往遠方，流落異邦， 找不到安居之所。 她在走投無路之際被追敵擒獲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;通往錫安的道路滿目淒涼， 因為無人前去過節。 她的城門冷落， 她的祭司悲歎， 她的少女哀傷，她痛苦不已。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;仇敵做了她的主人， 她的敵人安逸發達。 因為她作惡多端， 耶和華叫她飽受困苦， 她的孩子被敵人擄去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;少女錫安的尊榮消逝， 她的首領像找不到草吃的鹿， 無力逃脫敵人的追趕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;在困苦流離中， 耶路撒冷想起昔日的榮華。 如今，她的人民落在敵人手中， 無人援救。 她的仇敵幸災樂禍，嘲笑她的滅亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷罪大惡極， 淪為污穢之物。 從前尊重她的人看見她赤身裸體，就蔑視她。 她只能哀歎、退避。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她的裙子沾滿污穢， 她未曾想過自己的結局。 她的敗落令人震驚， 無人安慰。 她哭喊道：「耶和華啊， 仇敵已經獲勝， 求你垂顧我的苦難！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;敵人伸手奪去她的一切珍寶。 她目睹外族人闖入聖殿， 耶和華禁止他們進入祂的會眾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;她的人民呻吟著四處覓食， 用珍寶換取糧食維生。 她說：「耶和華啊，求你垂顧我， 因為我被人蔑視。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;「路人啊，你們都無動於衷嗎？ 你們看看， 耶和華向我發烈怒，降禍於我， 還有誰比我更痛苦呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;「祂從高天降下火來， 使火在我骨中燃燒； 祂在我腳前設下網羅， 使我返回； 祂使我淒涼孤寂，終日痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;「我的罪惡連接成軛， 祂親手把它們綁在一起， 繫在我的頸項上， 使我精疲力盡。 主把我交給我無力抵擋的敵人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;「主棄絕我所有的勇士， 召集軍隊攻擊我， 打垮我的青年。 主踐踏處女猶大， 如同在榨酒池中踩踏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;「我為此哭泣， 淚流滿面， 卻無人安慰、鼓勵我。 我的兒女淒涼孤苦， 因為仇敵已經得勝。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;錫安伸手求助，卻無人安慰她。 耶和華已命四周鄰國與雅各為敵。 耶路撒冷在他們當中成了污穢之物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;「但耶和華是公義的， 因為我違背了祂的命令。 萬國啊，請聽我的話， 看看我的痛苦！ 我的少男少女都被擄去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;「我向情人們求助， 他們卻欺騙我。 我的祭司和長老在覓食求生時， 倒斃在城中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;「耶和華啊， 看看我是多麼痛苦！ 我愁腸百結， 我的心靈翻騰， 因為我極其悖逆。 街上有刀劍奪命， 家中有死亡籠罩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;「人們聽見我的哀歎， 卻無人安慰我。 敵人聽說你降給我的災難， 都幸災樂禍。 願你宣告的審判之日來臨， 叫他們像我一樣受苦！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;「願他們的惡行都擺在你眼前！ 你怎樣因我一切的罪惡而懲罰我， 願你也照樣懲罰他們！ 我歎息不絕，心中哀傷。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;主的怒氣像烏雲一樣遮蓋少女錫安， 祂將以色列的榮美從天上扔到地上。 祂發怒的時候並不顧念自己的腳凳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;主毫不留情地毀滅雅各一切的住處， 祂在烈怒中夷平猶大的堡壘， 讓以色列及其首領蒙羞。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;祂發烈怒毀滅以色列全軍。 敵人襲來時，祂收回援手。 祂像烈焰一樣吞噬雅各。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;祂張弓搭箭，宛若仇敵， 祂的右手蓄勢待發， 祂殺了一切悅人眼目的人， 將祂的怒火撒向少女錫安的帳篷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;主像敵人一樣毀滅以色列， 吞噬她的宮殿，夷平她的堡壘， 使猶大人悲傷哀哭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂摧毀自己的居所， 如同摧毀花園； 祂摧毀祂所定的聚會之處， 使錫安的人民忘記安息日和節期。 祂在烈怒中棄絕所有的君王和祭司。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;主撇棄自己的祭壇， 憎惡自己的聖所， 把耶路撒冷的殿牆交給敵人。 他們像過節一樣， 在耶和華的殿中喧嚷吵鬧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和華決意拆毀少女錫安的城牆， 祂拉了準線， 定意毀滅，絕不收手。 祂使城牆和壁壘一同悲哀哭泣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;錫安的城門陷入地中， 主已摧毀、砍斷她的門閂。 她的君王和首領流落異邦， 律法不復存在， 她的先知得不到從耶和華而來的異象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;少女錫安的長老腰束麻布， 頭蒙灰塵，坐在地上， 默然不語； 耶路撒冷的少女垂頭至地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我哭得眼睛失明， 愁腸百結，肝膽欲碎， 因為人民慘遭毀滅， 兒童和嬰孩昏倒在城中的街頭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;孩子們問母親： 「哪裡有餅和酒呢？」 他們像受傷的勇士， 昏倒在城中的街頭， 在母親懷中奄奄一息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;少女耶路撒冷啊，我該說什麼呢？ 我用什麼比作你呢？ 處女錫安啊，我用什麼比作你，好安慰你呢？ 你的傷口深如海洋， 誰能醫治你呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你的先知所見的異象虛假無用。 他們沒有揭露你的罪惡， 以致你被擄。 他們給你的預言虛假謬誤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;路人都拍掌嘲笑你。 他們向少女耶路撒冷搖頭， 嗤笑道： 「這就是那被譽為完美無瑕、 普世喜悅的城嗎？」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;敵人都幸災樂禍地譏諷你， 他們咬牙切齒地嗤笑說： 「我們吞滅了她！ 這是我們期待已久的日子！ 我們終於見到這一天了！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和華實現了祂的計劃， 成就了祂很久以前的應許。 祂毫不留情地毀滅了你， 使你的仇敵幸災樂禍， 使你的敵人耀武揚威。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;少女錫安的城牆啊， 你要從心裡向主呼求！ 你的眼淚要像江河一樣晝夜湧流， 你要不歇不眠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你要在夜間打更時起來呼求， 在主面前傾心吐意，如水倒出。 你要為餓昏街頭的孩童向主舉手禱告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;「耶和華啊，求你看看， 你曾這樣對付過誰呢？ 母親豈能吃自己生養的孩子？ 祭司和先知豈能在主的聖所中被殺？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;「老人和少年陳屍街頭， 少男少女都喪身刀下。 你在發怒的日子殺了他們， 毫不留情。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;「你從四面八方召仇敵攻擊我， 如同召集人過節。 耶和華發怒的日子， 無人能逃脫，無人能倖免。 敵人殺光了我養育的孩子。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我在耶和華烈怒的杖下受盡痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;祂把我趕進黑暗， 使我行路不見光明，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;又屢屢攻擊我，終日不斷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;祂使我皮肉枯槁， 祂折斷我的骨頭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;祂使我四面受困， 嘗盡痛苦艱辛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;祂使我住在幽暗中， 像久已死去的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;祂圍困我，使我無法逃脫， 祂給我戴上沉重的鎖鏈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;即使我哀哭呼求， 祂也掩耳不聽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;祂用鑿好的石頭阻擋我的去路， 使我的道路曲折難行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;祂像埋伏的巨熊， 又像伺機突襲的猛獅，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;把我拖離大路， 撕成碎片，使我一片淒涼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;祂彎弓搭箭，把我當箭靶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;祂用箭袋中的箭射穿我的心臟。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我成了萬民的笑柄， 他們終日唱歌諷刺我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;祂使我飽受苦楚，嘗盡苦澀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;祂用石子硌斷我的牙齒， 把我踐踏在塵土中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你使我失去平安， 忘記了什麼是福樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我說：「我精疲力竭， 對耶和華失去盼望。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;想起我的痛苦和漂泊流離， 就如苦艾和膽汁一樣苦澀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;那情景縈繞心頭， 使我心情沉重。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;然而，我想起這事， 便有了盼望，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;因為耶和華的慈愛永不終止， 祂的憐憫永無窮盡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;祂的慈愛和憐憫每天早晨都是新的， 祂的信實無比偉大！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;我心裡知道， 耶和華是我的福分， 我要仰望祂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;耶和華必恩待那些等候和尋求祂的人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;因此，默然等候耶和華的拯救是美好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;年輕時負軛受苦是有益的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;受耶和華管教時， 要默然獨坐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;要謙卑地臉伏於地， 或許還有希望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003030",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;要任人打臉，甘受凌辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003031",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;因為主不會永遠撇棄人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003032",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;主儘管使人憂傷， 祂依然憐憫人， 因為祂有豐盛的慈愛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003033",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:33",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003033",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>33</sup>&nbsp;祂不願使人憂傷、痛苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003034",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:34",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003034",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>34</sup>&nbsp;將囚犯踩在腳下，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003035",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:35",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003035",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>35</sup>&nbsp;在至高者面前冤枉他人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003036",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:36",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003036",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>36</sup>&nbsp;審理案件時顛倒是非， 都是主所不容許的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003037",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:37",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003037",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>37</sup>&nbsp;若非主發命令， 誰能說成就成呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003038",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:38",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003038",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>38</sup>&nbsp;禍福豈不都出自至高者的口嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003039",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:39",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003039",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>39</sup>&nbsp;世人因自己的罪受罰， 又何必怨天尤人呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003040",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:40",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003040",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>40</sup>&nbsp;讓我們省察自己的行為， 重新歸向耶和華吧！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003041",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:41",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003041",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>41</sup>&nbsp;讓我們舉起雙手， 誠心向天上的上帝禱告說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003042",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:42",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003042",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>42</sup>&nbsp;「我們犯罪、背叛， 你沒有赦免我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003043",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:43",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003043",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>43</sup>&nbsp;「你滿懷憤怒地追趕我們， 毫不留情地殺戮我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003044",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:44",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003044",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>44</sup>&nbsp;你以密雲遮蓋自己， 以致禱告達不到你那裡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003045",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:45",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003045",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>45</sup>&nbsp;你使我們在列國中淪為廢物、渣滓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003046",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:46",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003046",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>46</sup>&nbsp;「我們的仇敵都幸災樂禍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003047",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:47",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003047",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>47</sup>&nbsp;我們充滿恐懼， 面臨陷阱、殘害和毀滅。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003048",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:48",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003048",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>48</sup>&nbsp;因同胞被毀滅，我淚流成河。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003049",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:49",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003049",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>49</sup>&nbsp;我的眼淚湧流不息，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003050",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:50",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003050",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>50</sup>&nbsp;直到耶和華從天上垂顧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003051",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:51",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003051",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>51</sup>&nbsp;目睹城中婦女的遭遇， 我痛苦不已。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003052",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:52",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003052",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>52</sup>&nbsp;敵人無故地追捕我， 如同捕獵飛鳥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003053",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:53",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003053",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>53</sup>&nbsp;他們把我推進坑裡， 又用石頭砸我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003054",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:54",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003054",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>54</sup>&nbsp;水已經漫過我的頭， 我想我要滅亡了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003055",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:55",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003055",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>55</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊， 我在深坑呼求你的名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003056",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:56",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003056",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>56</sup>&nbsp;你曾垂聽我的呼求， 求你現在不要掩耳不聽我的求救聲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003057",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:57",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003057",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>57</sup>&nbsp;我向你呼求的時候， 你曾走近我身旁， 安慰我說：「不要害怕！」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003058",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:58",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003058",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>58</sup>&nbsp;主啊，你為我申了冤， 救贖了我的性命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003059",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:59",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003059",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>59</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，你已明察我的冤情， 求你為我主持公道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003060",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:60",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003060",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>60</sup>&nbsp;你看見了他們怎樣仇恨我、 謀害我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003061",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:61",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003061",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>61</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊， 你聽見了他們怎樣辱罵我、 謀害我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003062",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:62",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003062",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>62</sup>&nbsp;他們整天誹謗我，圖謀害我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003063",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:63",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003063",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>63</sup>&nbsp;你看！他們或坐下或起來， 都唱歌諷刺我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003064",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:64",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003064",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>64</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊， 求你按照他們的所作所為報應他們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003065",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:65",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003065",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>65</sup>&nbsp;求你使他們心裡剛硬， 讓你的咒詛落在他們身上！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003066",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:66",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003066",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>66</sup>&nbsp;求你發怒追趕他們， 從你諸天之下剷除他們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;黃金竟失去光澤， 純金竟變色， 寶石竟被棄之街頭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;錫安的寶貝兒女本來貴如純金， 現在竟被視為陶匠製作的瓦器！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;豺狼尚且哺養自己的幼兒， 我的百姓卻像荒野的鴕鳥般殘忍。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;嬰兒乾渴難忍，舌頭緊貼上膛； 孩童乞求食物，卻無人給予。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;昔日吃美味佳餚的， 如今在街頭窮困潦倒； 穿錦衣紫袍長大的， 如今躺臥在糞堆中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;雖然無人攻擊，所多瑪卻在頃刻之間傾覆。 我的百姓比所多瑪受到的懲罰更重。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;錫安的首領曾比雪純淨， 比奶更白， 身體比紅寶石更紅潤， 相貌美如藍寶石。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;現在，他們的面目比煤炭還黑， 走在街上無人認得。 他們骨瘦如柴，乾如枯木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;死於刀下的勝過死於饑餓的， 就是因田間缺糧而餓死的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我的百姓遭毀滅時， 慈母親手煮自己的兒女充饑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和華大發烈怒， 傾倒祂的怒氣， 在錫安燃起大火， 焚毀城的根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;地上的君王和世上的居民都不相信敵人能闖進耶路撒冷的城門。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;這都是因為她先知的罪行和祭司的過犯。 他們在城中殺害義人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他們如盲人在街上遊蕩， 沾滿血污， 無人敢碰他們的衣服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;人們向他們喊道： 「走開！你們是不潔的！ 走開！走開！不要靠近我們。」 於是他們逃亡、流蕩， 列國的人說： 「他們不可再住在我們這裡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和華親自驅散他們， 不再眷顧他們； 人們不再尊重祭司， 也不再恩待長老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我們望眼欲穿， 盼望援軍的到來， 盼望的卻是無力拯救之國。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;敵人步步緊逼， 使我們不敢上自己的街。 我們的結局近了， 我們的日子到頭了， 我們的結局來了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;追趕我們的人比飛鷹更快， 他們在山上追捕我們， 在曠野伏擊我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我們的生命之氣—— 耶和華膏立的王落入他們的陷阱。 我們原希望藉他的蔭庇立足於列國中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你們住在烏斯地區的以東人啊， 只管歡喜作樂吧！ 因為盛滿耶和華憤怒的杯也要傳到你們那裡。 你們必喝醉，以致赤身露體。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;少女錫安啊！你已經受到了應得的刑罰， 耶和華必不再使你流亡。 少女以東啊，耶和華要因你的罪過而懲罰你， 揭露你的罪惡！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你顧念我們的遭遇， 看看我們所受的恥辱！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我們的土地被陌生人侵佔， 我們的房屋落入外族人手中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們成了喪父的孤兒， 我們的母親成了寡婦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我們喝水要付錢， 燒的柴要用錢買。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;敵人緊追不捨， 我們疲憊不堪，不得安歇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;為了得到食物， 我們向埃及、亞述卑躬屈膝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我們的祖先犯了罪， 已經逝去， 我們卻要承擔他們的罪責。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;奴僕做了我們的主人， 無人從他們手中解救我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;曠野中殺機四伏， 我們冒著生命危險才得到糧食。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我們因饑餓而發熱， 皮膚熱如烤爐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;婦女在錫安遭強暴， 少女在猶大的城邑被姦污。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;首領雙手被吊起來， 老人得不到尊敬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;青年被迫推磨， 孩童肩背柴捆，步履蹣跚。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;老人不再坐在城門口， 青年不再彈琴奏樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我們心中的快樂消失， 我們的舞蹈變成了哀哭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;榮耀的冠冕從我們頭上落下。 我們犯了罪，我們有禍了！</p>"
  },
